0→H
A=71⇒B=18⇒1→H
A=124⇒B=11⇒2→H
A=65⇒B=44⇒3→H
A=86⇒B=34⇒4→H
H⇒Goto H
If Z>30 And A=60 And B=42 And Not Mat Z[10,2
Then 
  ClrText
  "Z> Le tresor..."◢
  "Ca semble trop"
